<title>USA: Earthgrains knows no reason for rise.</title>
<headline>Earthgrains knows no reason for rise.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earthgrains Co Inc said Friday it knows of no reason for the rise in its stock price.</p>
<p>Earthgrains shares were up 3-3/4 at 51-1/8 in the mid-afternoon.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
